    "evidence": "The oversized “One payment. Two very different answers.” headline and side-by-side Legacy ALLOW versus Intent Integrity BLOCK create a clear demo moment. However, most of the visual language—dark table, cyan/red status pills, monospaced labels, bordered cards—is familiar cybersecurity-dashboard styling. The central causal-seam idea is visually subordinate, especially on mobile where it follows eight repetitive transaction rows.",
